    "category": "Nonautomatic weighing instrument",
    "type_designations": ["GLP-W..."],
    "description": "Nonautomatic, electromechanical, pricecomputing weighing instrument. The weighing instrument consists of an indicator, comprising a microprocessor-system for further signal processing and control of the balance operation with thermal printer, LC-display, indicating weight with price, tare values and additional information, and of a weighing module, comprising the load receptor and the strain gauge load cell. The A/D converter for signal processing may be incorporated either in the indicator or in the weighing module. The weighing ranges with Max, Min, e, d and number of verification scale intervals may be chosen within the limits of No. 3.2 of R 76-1 and of table 1."
  },
